hadiths[51]{hadithnumber,text}:
"727","Umar bin Abi Salama (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Allah ka naam lo aur daayein haath se khao aur apne saamney se khao. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"728","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi khaey to Allah Taala ka naam zikr karey, phir agar wo shuru mein Allah Taala ka naam zikr karna bhool jaey to kahey: Shuru aur aakhir mein Allah ke naam se. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai."
"729","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jab aadmi apne ghar mein dakhil hota hai aur apne dakhil honay aur apne khaaney par Allah Taala ka zikr karta hai to shaitaan apne saathiyon se kehta hai: Tumharey liye na raat ka thikana hai aur na raat ka khana, aur jab wo dakhil hota hai aur apne dakhil honay par Allah Taala ka zikr nahi karta to shaitaan kehta hai: Tum ne raat ka thikana pa liya, aur jab wo apne khaaney par Allah Taala ka zikr nahi karta to kehta hai: Tum ne raat ka thikana aur raat ka khana pa liya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"730","Huzaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath khaaney mein haazir hotey to apne haath na rakhtey yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) shuru kartey aur apna haath rakhtey. Aur ham aik martaba Aap ke sath khaaney mein haazir huey to aik londi aai goya usey dhakela ja raha tha, to wo khaaney mein apna haath rakhney lagi to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uska haath pakad liya, phir aik dehaati aaya goya usey dhakela ja raha tha to Aap ne uska haath pakad liya, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak shaitaan khaana halaal kar leta hai jis par Allah Taala ka naam zikr na kya gaya ho, aur wo is londi ko lekar aaya taake uske zariye usey halaal karey, to main ne uska haath pakad liya, phir wo is dehaati ko lekar aaya taake uske zariye usey halaal karey, to main ne uska haath pakad liya, aur us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Beshak uska haath merey haath mein hai un donon ke haathon ke sath. Phir Allah Taala ka naam zikr kya aur khaaya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"731","Umayya bin Makhshi Sahaabi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baithey huey they aur aik aadmi kha raha tha, to us ne Allah ka naam nahi liya yahan tak ke uske khaaney mein se sirf aik luqma baqi reh gaya, phir jab us ne usey apne munh ki taraf uthaya to kaha: Shuru aur aakhir mein Allah ke naam se. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hansey, phir farmaya: Shaitaan uske sath khaata raha, phir jab us ne Allah ka naam zikr kya to us ne wo qai kar diya jo uske pait mein tha. Ise Abu Dawud aur Nasaai ne riwayat kya hai."
"732","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne chhey sahaaba mein khaana kha rahey they ke aik dehaati aaya aur usey do luqmon mein kha gaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khabardaar! Beshak agar wo Allah ka naam leta to tum sab ke liye kaafi ho jata. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai."
"733","Abu Umama (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab apna dastraqdaam uthatey to farmatey: Tamam tareefein Allah ke liye bahut zyada paakiza barkat wali hamd, na kaafi samjhi gai aur na chhori gai, aur na us se be-niyaazi hai ae hamarey Rab. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"734","Muaz bin Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs khaana khaey phir kahey: Tamam tareefein Allah ke liye hain jis ne mujhey ye khilaya aur mujhey baghair meri taqat aur quwwat ke ata kya, to uske guzashta gunah bakhsh diye jatey hain. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai."
"735","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kabhi kisi khaaney mein aib nahi nikala, agar Aap usey pasand farmatey to kha letey aur agar napasand farmatey to chhor detey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"736","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne ghar walon se saalan maanga to unhon-ne kaha: Hamarey paas sirkey ke siwa kuchh nahi. To Aap ne usey maanga aur khaatey jaatey aur farmatey jaatey: Sirka kitna achchha saalan hai, sirka kitna achchha saalan hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"737","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ko bulaya jaey to qabool karey, phir agar wo rozedaar ho to dua karey aur agar roza se na ho to khaey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"738","Abu Masood Badri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khaaney ki dawat di jo us ne Aap ke liye paanch mein paanchwaan bankar banaya tha, to aik aadmi unke peechey chal pada, phir jab darwazey tak pahunchy to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak ye hamarey peechey aaya hai, phir agar tum chaho to usey ijazat do aur agar chaho to wo wapas jaey. Us ne kaha: Balke main usey ijazat deta hun ya Rasulullah. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"739","Umar bin Abi Salama (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki god mein ladka tha aur mera haath pyaaley mein ghoomta tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Ae ladkey! Allah Taala ka naam lo aur daayein haath se khao aur apne saamney se khao. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"740","Salma bin Al-Akwa se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas baayein haath se khaaya to Aap ne farmaya: Daayein haath se khao. Us ne kaha: Main taqat nahi rakhta. Aap ne farmaya: Tu taqat na rakh sakey! Usey takabbur ke siwa kisi chiz ne nahi roka tha! To us ne usey apne munh ki taraf na uthaya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"741","Jabala bin Suhaim se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ibn Zubair ke sath hamein qehat ka saal pahuncha aur hamein khajoor di gaein, aur Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) hamarey paas se guzartey jabke ham kha rahey they, to wo farmatey: Do do mila kar na khao, kyonke Nabi Karim ne do mila kar khaaney se mana farmaya hai, phir farmatey: Siwaey iske ke aadmi apne bhai se ijazat ley. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"742","Wahshi bin Harb (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaaba ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak ham khaatey hain aur sair nahi hotey. Aap ne farmaya: Shayad tum juda juda khaatey ho. Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Apne khaaney par jama hojao aur Allah ka naam zikr karo, tumharey liye us mein barkat hogi. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai."
"743","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Barkat khaaney ke darmiyaan mein utarti hai, isliye uske kinaaron se khao aur uske darmiyaan se na khao. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai."
"744","Abdullah bin Busr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka aik bada pyaala tha jisey Gharra kaha jata tha, usey chaar aadmi uthatey they, phir jab subah hoti aur chaasht ki namaz padhtey to wo pyaala laaya jata, yaani us mein sareed banaya gaya hota, to log us par jama hotey, phir jab zyada ho jaatey to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghutnon ke bal baith jaatey. To aik dehaati ne kaha: Ye kaisi baithak hai? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne mujhey izzat wala banda banaya hai aur mujhey sarkash ziddee nahi banaya, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Uske ird gird se khao aur uski choti ko chhor do taake us mein barkat ho. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai."
"745","Abu Juhafa Wahb bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main tek laga kar nahi khaata. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"746","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ukdu baith kar khajoor khaatey dekha. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"747","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi khaana khaey to apni ungliyan na ponchhey yahan tak ke unhey chaat ley ya chata ley. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"748","Kaab bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko teen ungliyon se khaatey dekha, phir jab farigh hotey to unhey chaat-tey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"749","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ungliyan aur pyaala chaat-ney ka hukm diya aur farmaya: Beshak tum nahi jaantey ke tumharey khaaney ke kis hissey mein barkat hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"750","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ka luqma gir jaey to usey utha ley phir jo takleef deh chiz us par lagi hai usey door karey aur usey kha ley, aur usey shaitaan ke liye na chhorey, aur apna haath romaal se na ponchhey yahan tak ke apni ungliyan chaat ley, kyonke wo nahi jaanta ke uske khaaney ke kis hissey mein barkat hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"751","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak shaitaan tum mein se har aik ke paas uske har muamley mein haazir hota hai, yahan tak ke uske khaaney par haazir hota hai, phir jab tum mein se kisi ka luqma gir jaey to usey utha ley aur jo takleef deh chiz us par lagi hai usey door karey, phir usey kha ley aur usey shaitaan ke liye na chhorey, phir jab farigh ho to apni ungliyan chaat ley, kyonke wo nahi jaanta ke uske khaaney ke kis hissey mein barkat hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"752","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab khaana khaatey to apni teen ungliyan chaat-tey aur farmatey: Jab tum mein se kisi ka luqma gir jaey to usey utha ley aur us se takleef deh chiz door karey aur usey kha ley aur usey shaitaan ke liye na chhorey. Aur hamein hukm diya ke pyaala saaf karein aur farmaya: Beshak tum nahi jaantey ke tumharey khaaney ke kis hissey mein barkat hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"753","Saeed bin Al-Haaris se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se aag se chhooi hui chiz par wuzu ke baarey mein poochha to unhon-ne kaha: Nahi, ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein is tarah ka khaana thoda hi paatey they, phir jab ham usey paatey to hamarey paas hatheliyon aur kalaaiyon aur qadmon ke siwa koi romaal na hotey, phir ham namaz padhtey aur wuzu na kartey. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"754","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do ka khaana teen ke liye kaafi hai aur teen ka khaana chaar ke liye kaafi hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"755","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Aik ka khaana do ke liye kaafi hai, aur do ka khaana chaar ke liye kaafi hai, aur chaar ka khaana aath ke liye kaafi hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"756","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) peeney mein teen martaba saans letey they. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"757","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Oont ki tarah aik saans mein na piyo, lekin do aur teen martaba mein piyo, aur Allah ka naam lo jab tum piyo aur hamd karo jab tum bartan uthayo. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai."
"758","Abu Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bartan mein saans leney se mana farmaya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"759","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas doodh laaya gaya jis mein pani milaya gaya tha, aur Aap ke daayein taraf dehaati tha aur baayein taraf Abu Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) they, to Aap ne piya phir dehaati ko diya aur farmaya: Daayein wala phir daayein wala. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"760","Sehel bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas sharbat laaya gaya, to Aap ne us mein se piya jabke Aap ke daayein taraf ladka tha aur baayein taraf boodhey they, to Aap ne ladkey se farmaya: Kya tum mujhey ijazat detey ho ke main inhey dun? To ladkey ne kaha: Allah ki qasam nahi, main tum se apney hissey par kisi ko tarjeeh nahi dunga, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey apne haath mein rakh diya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"761","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah ne mashqeezon ke munh morney se mana farmaya, yaani ke unke munh torey jaein aur un se piya jaey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"762","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mashqeeza ya chamdey ki thaili ke munh se peeney se mana farmaya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"763","Umm Saabit Kabsha bint Saabit jo Hassaan bin Saabit ki behan hain (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) merey paas tashreef laey aur latki hui mashqeeza ke munh se khadey hokar piya, to main uske munh ki taraf uthi aur usey kaat diya. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai. Aur us ne usey sirf isliye kaata taake Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke munh ki jagah mehfooz rakhey aur us se barkat hasil karey aur usey aam istemaal se bachaey. Aur ye hadis jawaaz ke bayaan par mehmool hai, aur peechli do ahadis afzal aur akmal ke bayaan ke liye hain, aur Allah behtar jaanta hai."
"764","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sharbat mein phoonkney se mana farmaya, to aik aadmi ne kaha: Tinka jo main bartan mein dekhta hun? To Aap ne farmaya: Usey baha do. Us ne kaha: Beshak main aik saans se sair nahi hota? Aap ne farmaya: To phir pyaala apne munh se door kar lo. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai."
"765","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bartan mein saans leney ya us mein phoonkney se mana farmaya. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai."
"766","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Zamzam pilaya to Aap ne khadey hokar piya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"767","Nazzaal bin Sabra (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ali (Raziallahu anhu) Rahba ke darwazey par aey aur khadey hokar piya, aur farmaya: Beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha ke Aap ne aisa kya jaisa tum ne mujhey kartey dekha. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"768","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ahd mein chaltey huey khaatey they aur khadey hokar peetey they. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai."
"769","Amr bin Shuaib se apne walid se apne dada (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khadey hokar ya baith kar peetey dekha. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai."
"770","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne aadmi ke khadey hokar peeney se mana farmaya. Qatada ne kaha: To ham ne Anas se kaha: To khaana? Unhon-ne kaha: Wo zyada bura, ya zyada khabees hai. Aur unki aik riwayat mein hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khadey hokar peeney se roka. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur unki aik riwayat mein hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khadey hokar peeney se roka."
"771","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi khadey hokar na piye, phir jo bhool jaey to qai karey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"772","Abu Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qaum ko pilaney wala sab se aakhir mein peeta hai. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai."
"773","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Namaz ka waqt aaya to jo ghar ke qareeb tha wo apne ghar walon ki taraf gaya aur kuchh log baqi rahey, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas pathar ka aik lagan laaya gaya, phir lagan itna chhota tha ke Aap apni hatheli us mein pheelatey, phir tamaam logon ne wuzu kya. Unhon-ne kaha: Tum kitney they? Unhon-ne kaha: Assi se zyada. (Muttafaqun aleh). Ye Bukhari ki riwayat hai. Aur Muslim ki riwayat mein hai: Ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne pani ka bartan maanga, to chaudey munh wala piyala laaya gaya jis mein thoda pani tha, to Aap ne us mein apni ungliyan rakhein. Anas ne kaha: To main pani ko Aap ki ungliyon ke darmiyaan se phoot-tey huey dekhney laga, to main ne andaza lagaya ke wuzu karne waley sattar se assi ke darmiyaan they."
"774","Abdullah bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey paas tashreef laey to ham ne Aap ke liye peetal ke bartan mein pani nikala aur Aap ne wuzu kya. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"775","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Ansaar mein se aik aadmi ke paas aey jabke Aap ke sath Aap ka aik saathi tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar tumharey paas pani hai jo is raat mashqeeza mein raha ho warna ham chullu se piyengey. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"776","Huzaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein resham aur deebaaj aur soney chaandi ke bartanon mein peeney se mana farmaya aur farmaya: Ye unke liye duniya mein hain aur tumharey liye aakhirat mein. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"777","Umm Salama (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs chaandi ke bartan mein peeta hai wo sirf apne pait mein dozakh ki aag bhar raha hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Aap ke qaul mein hai: Beshak jo chaandi aur soney ke bartan mein khaata ya peeta hai. Aur unki aik riwayat mein hai: Jo shakhs soney ya chaandi ke bartan mein piye to wo sirf apne pait mein dozakh ki aag bhar raha hai."
